WEBVTT

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:18.090
"Eureka Seven AO"

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:21.800
"Eureka" "Renton"

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:56.790
"Episode 24: <i>The Door into Summer"</i>

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:38.630
"Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Japan

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:38.630
Administrative Vice Foreign Minister Nakamura"

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.710
"United Okinawa State Department

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.710
Under Secretary of State Jiro Kaneshiro"

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:34.470
<i>This uncertain world of mine now</i>

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:41.900
<i>Begins to change and expand</i>

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:41.900
<i>in the blink of an eye</i>

00:22:51.950 --> 00:22:57.210
<i>Where is the rest of the dream</i>

00:22:51.950 --> 00:22:57.210
<i>that I found that day?</i>

00:22:57.410 --> 00:23:01.840
<i>Just watch, I'll find it soon enough</i>

00:23:02.920 --> 00:23:08.220
<i>Even now, I alone remember</i>

00:23:08.430 --> 00:23:11.970
<i>The familiar old warmth</i>

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:18.480
<i>So, shall I get going now?</i>

00:23:18.690 --> 00:23:23.900
<i>The fate awaiting me</i>

00:23:24.110 --> 00:23:29.450
<i>Frightened and paralyzed me</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:34.620
<i>To never be lost ever again</i>

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:37.700
<i>I'll grow stronger</i>

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:43.250
<i>Even the past I can never return to</i>

00:23:43.460 --> 00:23:48.760
<i>I'll build upon, starting tomorrow</i>

00:23:48.970 --> 00:23:53.930
<i>That's what I'll do to overcome it all</i>

00:23:54.140 --> 00:23:58.480
<i>And that's how I'll become me</i>
